<section class="bg-base-200 text-base-content">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[84rem] px-5 py-24 md:px-8 md:py-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[40rem] text-center" data-reveal>
      <p class="engraved text-base-content/75">August 2025 · Arch Rock</p>
      <h2 class="section-title mt-5">The question</h2>
    </div>
    {% render 'diecut', src: "/media/arch-rock-wide.jpg", shape: "arch", class: "mx-auto mt-14 aspect-[16/9] w-full max-w-[60rem] paper" %}
    <div class="mx-auto mt-14 grid max-w-[60rem] gap-12 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-16">
      <div data-reveal>
        <p class="script text-[2.75rem] text-primary">Callum says</p>
        <p class="body-copy mt-4 text-[1.0625rem]">I had planned it for a month and practiced on the dog. The plan was sunrise at Arch Rock, the ring in the basket, one knee on the boardwalk. The plan did not include a headwind the whole way round, so I proposed a little out of breath.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-reveal>
        <p class="script text-[2.75rem] text-primary">Iris says</p>
        <p class="body-copy mt-4 text-[1.0625rem]">Nobody suggests a 5 am bike ride for old times' sake. I knew by the fudge shop. What I didn't know was that he'd fixed the basket on that same old bike and tracked it down to rent again, and that's when I cried. I said yes before he had finished asking.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
